@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Accordion}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Quirks_Issues}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</PageTitle>

<section class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Class @GlobalValues.Info_Box_Coloured_Modifier">
    <h1 class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Heading_Class">@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</h1>

    <p>
        Below are all the quirks and/or issues that I experienced whilst testing the Accordion component.
    </p>
    <p>
        There is no <span class="code-span">role="accordion"</span> so predictably all of the windows based screen readers do not switch into their
        respective forms mode (focus mode/Scan mode off/Virtual pc cursor off).
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section-box">
    <h2 id="screen-reader-quirks" class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Heading_Class">Screen reader quirks</h2>
    <ul aria-labelledby="screen-reader-quirks">
        <li>
            <b>Narrator</b> more often than not will not announce that the accordion item has been expanded after clicking the heading when
            paired with either Edge or Chrome, but is fine when paired with Firefox.
        </li>
        <li><b>NVDA</b> on all browsers. When in Browse mode on clicking a collapsed accordion header it will announce that its expanded, twice. 
            In Focus mode it works as expected.
        </li>
        <li>
            <b>JAWS</b> paired with Firefox will sometimes repeat accordion heading names and actions, expanded/collapsed.
        </li>
        <li>
            <b>VoiceOver</b> on the macOS paired with Safari seems to stutter on expanding accordion items.
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <strong>Note: </strong> The same quirks were also noted in the ARIA Authoring Practices Guide (APG) example.
    </p>
</section>


<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Accordion}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview_Tests}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview_Tests</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Busy}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Busy_Overview_Page_Test}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Busy - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview_Page_Tests</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>

